WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
If you're on a split dose prep, it's time to walk through your second dose.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.830
Confirm with your written instructions. Split dosing means you take the first

3
00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:09.280
half of your

4
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.880
prep the evening before and the second half the morning of your procedure,

5
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.480
typically six hours

6
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:19.270
before your arrival time. When you wake up tomorrow, mix and drink your second

7
00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.000
dose as directed on your

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.900
prep instructions. Continue drinking clear liquids after your dose until the

9
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.360
cutoff time we've specified.

10
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.560
Your goal is to keep going until your output runs clear. That's how we know

11
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:30.560
your prep is working.

12
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.740
If you have any concerns about how things are going, call our office first

13
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:35.840
thing in the morning.

14
00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.040
You're almost done.
